{'symbol': 'MAR', 'date': '2022-12-14 11:51:00', 'title': 'EXPERTS CONVERGE TO CHART PATH AHEAD FOR WEDDING INDUSTRY AT SAN JUAN MARRIOTT RESORT & STELLARIS CASINO', 'text': 'IN A SESSION TITLED TRADITIONS, TRENDS & NEW INSPIRATIONS FOR DESTINATION WEDDINGS, INDUSTRY EXPERTS GATHERED TO DISCUSS THE STATE OF THE INDUSTRY AND WHY PUERTO RICO PROVIDES THE IDEAL GETAWAY FOR A DESTINATION WEDDING AND HONEYMOON. SAN JUAN, PUERTO RICO, DEC. 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL IN THE CARIBBEAN AND LATIN AMERICA RECENTLY PARTNERED WITH WISH UPON A WEDDING, A NON-PROFIT ORGANIZATION THAT GRANTS WEDDINGS AND VOW RENEWALS TO COUPLES FACING SERIOUS ILLNESS OR LIFE-ALTERING HEALTH CIRCUMSTANCES, TO BRING TOGETHER TOP MEETING AND EVENT EXPERTS TO DISCUSS THE FUTURE OF THE INDUSTRY.'}